# Line-ending policy — keeps gofmt and git from fighting on Windows.
# Go source must be LF (gofmt enforces it); batch files must be CRLF
# (cmd.exe misparses LF in some constructs). Everything else: LF in the
# repo, as-is in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
